<title>JAPAN: Kitakyushu Coca-Cola plans share split.</title>
<headline>Kitakyushu Coca-Cola plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kitakyushu Coca-Cola Bottling Co Ltd said on Tuesday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on February 20, 1998, for shareholders as of December 31.</p>
</text>
